Repeated calls to ``get_parameter_data`` on a started ``DataSet``, and to methods built on it
such as ``to_pandas_dataframe`` and ``to_xarray_dataset``, are now faster as the run description
held by the dataset is used rather than reading and parsing it from the database on every call.
Calling ``get_parameter_data`` on a ``DataSet`` that has not been started now returns empty
arrays for its parameters rather than raising a ``KeyError``.
